<title>CANADA: Canada C$2.3 bln bond due 2007 yields 6.405 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$2.3 bln bond due 2007 yields 6.405 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$2.3 billion auction of 7.25 percent bonds due June 1, 2007 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>		   AVG     6.405     106.281  PCT AT</p>
<p>		   LOW     6.395     106.359  HI YIELD</p>
<p>		   HIGH    6.413     106.219   34.54887</p>
<p>The bonds will be dated and delivered on February 17. The outstanding debt of the issue totals C$7.1 billion. Bids from primary dealers totalled C$5,034.55 million, including C$67.05 million non-competitive tenders at the average yield.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
